    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, the tax law and the state finance law, in relation to providing for taxpayer gifts for women's cancers education and prevention and establishing the women's cancers education and prevention fund",
    "basePrintNo": "S5902",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5902-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
